<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    The memories of the land's year and the animals' newer wishes: clothes for the season, the sauna and sitting in it,
    a favourite animal and a pack animal of one's own, the planting day and bringing the herd home. Most good ones give
    something other than mood (ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead: comfort, rest, practice, a feeling, the journal); the two bad
    ones are small, with hints of their own (Defs/MoodHintDefs/Rimfolk_MoodHints_LandYear.xml).
  -->

  <!-- ===================== Wishes granted ===================== -->

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Granted_CoolClothes</defName>
    <durationDays>5</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>dressed for the heat</label><description>Shade on my head and air on my arms. I can work through the middle of the day without wilting.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>3</felt><comfort>0.15</comfort><feelings><li>Relief</li></feelings></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Granted_FavouriteAnimal</defName>
    <durationDays>5</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>my favourite animal</label><description>There's one of my favourite kind of animal here now, ours, in the herd. I keep finding reasons to walk past it.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>3</felt><joy>0.1</joy><journal>true</journal><feelings><li>Joy</li></feelings></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Granted_FavouriteBond</defName>
    <durationDays>6</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>it chose me</label><description>Of everyone here, it picked me. It comes when I whistle and sleeps where it can see me. I've wanted one like it all my life.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>4</felt><comfort>0.1</comfort><journal>true</journal><feelings><li>Tenderness</li></feelings></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Granted_PackAnimal</defName>
    <durationDays>5</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>a pack animal of my own</label><description>It carries what I carry and walks where I walk. I've already worked out how much it can take, and it's more than me.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>2</felt><skill>Animals</skill><xp>200</xp><feelings><li>Contentment</li></feelings></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <!-- ===================== The sauna ===================== -->

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Habit_SaunaWarmed</defName>
    <durationDays>1</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>1</stackLimit>
    <stages><li><label>warmed through in the sauna</label><description>I sat in the heat until the cold came out of my bones. My skin's still tingling.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>2</felt><comfort>0.12</comfort><rest>0.05</rest><feelings><li>Contentment</li></feelings></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <!-- ===================== The planting day ===================== -->

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Planting_GoodStart</defName>
    <durationDays>4</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>1</stackLimit>
    <stages><li><label>a good start</label><description>The fields we sowed together on the planting day are ripe, every row of them. It started right, and it came right.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>2</felt><skill>Plants</skill><xp>150</xp><journal>true</journal><feelings><li>Pride</li></feelings></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Dlm_PlantingSkipped</defName>
    <durationDays>3</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>1</stackLimit>
    <stages><li><label>no planting day</label><description>The fields opened and we went at them like any other job. The seed's in the ground. It doesn't feel like the year has started.</description><baseMoodEffect>-2</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.HeartTags"><feelings><li>Frustration</li></feelings><weight>0.2</weight></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Cal_PlantingDay</defName>
    <durationDays>4</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>1</stackLimit>
    <stages><li><label>the planting day</label><description>We kept the planting day: out in the fields together with the seed, and a few words at the edge when it was done. Whatever comes up this year, we started it together.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>3</felt><skill>Plants</skill><xp>200</xp><journal>true</journal><feelings><li>Hope</li></feelings></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <!-- ===================== Bringing the herd home ===================== -->

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Dlm_Trad_HerdHome</defName>
    <durationDays>3</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>1</stackLimit>
    <stages><li><label>brought the herd home</label><description>We walked the whole herd in before the weather turned, one rope at a time. They're under a roof tonight, and so are we.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>2</felt><skill>Animals</skill><xp>150</xp><feelings><li>Contentment</li></feelings></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Dlm_HerdLeftOut</defName>
    <durationDays>3</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>1</stackLimit>
    <stages><li><label>the herd left out</label><description>The council said the animals would find their own way in. Some of them are still standing out there in the weather.</description><baseMoodEffect>-2</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.HeartTags"><feelings><li>Worry</li></feelings><weight>0.3</weight></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

</Defs>
